        "text_XUXtJF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Healthy, resilient skin is the foundation of effective treatment preparation, recovery and results.</strong></p><p>Skin health plays a vital role in how the skin responds to professional aesthetic treatments. A weakened skin barrier, dehydration and inflammation can impact treatment outcomes and recovery. Targeted skincare helps prepare the skin before procedures, support regeneration and recovery, and maintain results for long-term skin health.</p><p><strong>ALLSKIN | MED combines patented technologies, evidence-based ingredients and professional treatment protocols to enhance skin readiness, support recovery and help optimise aesthetic treatment outcomes.</strong></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
