            "heading": "The science behind ALLSKIN | MED",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_wLcQgq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>ALLSKIN | MED combines patented SCA® PRO Growth Factor Technology and\nREOXDERM® antioxidant technology to support skin regeneration, barrier defence and recovery. Targeted depigmenting ingredients and Wharton Gel Complex® extend its scientific approach to pigmentation and scalp health.</p>\n<p>Laboratory studies of SCA have demonstrated increased proliferation and migration of keratinocytes and dermal fibroblasts, key processes involved in skin renewal and repair.<sup>1</sup> SCA technology is backed by more than 20 scientific publications.</p>\n<p>Clinical research on SCA 40% skincare following non-ablative fractional laser treatment reported 50% greater average wrinkle reduction after 28 days compared with treatment without the skincare.<sup>2</sup> Separate research demonstrated improved skin healing following ablative fractional laser treatment with early and continued\napplication of SCA 40%.<sup>3</sup></p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
