            "title": "",
            "text": "<p class=\"caption-with-letter-spacing caption-with-letter-spacing--medium\">REGENERATION &amp; RECOVERY</p>\n<h3>ALLSKIN | MED<br>Regenerating Ampoules</h3>\n<p>An intensive regenerative concentrate powered by 40% SCA® PRO Growth Factor Technology. Developed to support skin renewal, improve visible signs of ageing and soothe skin following professional aesthetic treatments.</p>",
            "link_label": "Discover Regenerating Ampoules",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_kiBcy9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/asm-collagen-activation-barrier_-1200x800.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p class=\"caption-with-letter-spacing caption-with-letter-spacing--medium\">COLLAGEN ACTIVATION &amp; BARRIER SUPPORT</p>\n<h3>ALLSKIN | MED<br>Collagen Activation Barrier+ Plan</h3>\n<p>A structured, three-product homecare plan combining targeted collagen activation with\nadvanced skin barrier support. Designed to prepare the skin for aesthetic treatments,\nsupport recovery and optimise skin health throughout the treatment journey.</p>",
            "link_label": "Discover Collagen Activation Barrier+",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_kzjaC9": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/asm-pigment-control-plan-1200x800.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p class=\"caption-with-letter-spacing caption-with-letter-spacing--medium\">PIGMENTATION MANAGEMENT</p>\n<h3>ALLSKIN | MED<br>Pigment Control Plan</h3>\n<p>A comprehensive homecare protocol combining targeted depigmenting ingredients, oral supplementation and advanced photoprotection. Developed to help improve uneven skin tone, complement professional pigmentation treatments and maintain\nresults.</p>",
            "link_label": "Discover Pigment Control Plan",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_awVYQ6": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/asm-hair-regeneration-plan-1200x800.jpg",
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p class=\"caption-with-letter-spacing caption-with-letter-spacing--medium\">HAIR &amp; SCALP REGENERATION</p>\n<h3>ALLSKIN | MED<br>Hair Regeneration Plan</h3>\n<p>A science-led, three-step homecare regime combining Wharton Gel Complex® Growth Factor Technology with targeted scalp care and nutritional support. Designed to complement professional hair regeneration treatments and support healthier, fuller looking\nhair.</p>",
            "link_label": "Discover Hair Regeneration Plan",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
